## Proposed System Architecture & Flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    UI[React Operations Dashboard / Flash Sale Trigger] -->|REST API & WebSockets| CTRL[Order Controller & WebSocket Broker]
    CTRL --> ORCH[Order Orchestrator Service]
    ORCH --> TP[Custom Java Thread Pool Executor]
    TP --> RES[Inventory Reservation Service]
    RES -->|PESSIMISTIC_WRITE Row Lock / Atomic Decr| DB[(MySQL Database)]
    RES -->|Reserved OK| PAY[Payment Simulator Service]
    RES -->|No Stock| OOS[OUT_OF_STOCK State]
    PAY -->|Success| CONF[ORDER_CONFIRMED & Picking/Packed/Shipped]
    PAY -->|Failure / Timeout| RETRY[Bounded Retry Engine - Max 3]
    RETRY -->|Retry Exhausted| DLQ[Dead Letter Queue Record]
    RETRY -->|Retry Attempt| PAY
    CONF --> WS[Live WebSocket Broadcast]
    OOS --> WS
    DLQ --> WS
    WS --> UI
```

